@startuml 08-confidence-scoring
title E3: ProvisionalConfidenceScoring.score(candidates, mentions), algorithm "provisional-1" (DS1-003)

skinparam shadowing false

start
:accepted + unclassified candidates
and the Mentions of the Analysis;
note right
  Placeholder until issue #9 (Marcin) delivers the real
  algorithm behind the same ConfidenceScoring port.
end note
while (next candidate?) is (yes)
  :supporting = Mentions whose id is in candidate.mentionIds;
  :rule MENTIONED_WITH_IDENTIFIER = 40
  (the address appears in a Mention that also names
   a narrowing identifier: cheat-sheet band 40-59,
   "needs a second trace");
  if (two supporting Mentions on different URL hosts\nwith a different text? (www., case, whitespace ignored)) then (yes)
    :rule INDEPENDENT_SOURCES = +15
    (cheat-sheet synergy rule);
  else (no)
    :no bonus: several Mentions on one service,
    or a copy of the same text on another service (E7.3);
  endif
  :ScoredAttribution(candidate,
    confidenceLevel = sum of contributions, capped 0..100,
    appliedRules);
endwhile (no)
:ScoringResult(attributions in input order,
algorithmVersion = "provisional-1");
note right
  Same Mentions -> same Confidence Level (order independent).
  Known gaps for #9: source kind bands (80-100 own profile,
  60-79 P2P ad, 10-39 mass comments), wallet entered by the
  Analyst is not evidence (D50-006), Justification text.
end note
stop

@enduml
